msgid ""
"Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Advance!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use the 6 special buttons "
"available right under the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr ""
"Wëllkomm bei RECALBOX fir Odroid Go Advance!\n"
"Dës kleng Presentatioun weist der, wéi s de déi 6 speziell Boutons benotz, "
"déi direkt ënnert dem Bildschierm verfügbar sinn.\n"
"\n"
"Dréck op eng Tast fir unzefänken!"

msgid ""
"The leftmost button is the SELECT button, marked with a 'I', also available "
"on most modern pads.\n"
"But it is also the HOTKEY button that you can use in conjunction with other "
"buttons in most emulators.\n"
"For example, you can use HOTKEY+START to quit the current game.\n"
"\n"
"Press the SELECT button."
msgstr ""
"Déi lénkst Tast ass d'SELECT-Tast, markéiert mat engem 'I', och op de "
"meeschte modernen Pads verfügbar.\n"
"Awer et ass och d'HOTKEY-Tast, déi s de zesumme mat aneren Tasten an de "
"meeschte Emulatore benotze kanns.\n"
"Zum Beispill kanns du HOTKEY+START benotzen fir dat aktuellt Spill zou ze "
"maachen.\n"
"\n"
"Dréck op d'SELECT-Tast."

msgid ""
"Next to the SELECT button is the START button, marked with an 'II'.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"Nieft der SELECT-Tast ass d'START-Tast, markéiert mat engem 'II'.\n"
"Benotz se fir d'Haaptmenü an der Recalbox-Interface opzemaachen an am Spill "
"wéi déi normal START-Tast déi op de meeschte Konsolen verfügbar ass.\n"
"\n"
"Dréck w.e.g. op dës START-Tast."

msgid ""
"Then, there are 2 buttons marked with a 'III' and a 'IV'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press either volume up or down (III/IV)."
msgstr ""
"Dann sinn et 2 Tasten markéiert mat 'III' an 'IV'.\n"
"Benotz se fir de Volume jidderzäit an der Recalbox-Interface oder am Spill "
"z'erhéijen oder ze senken.\n"
"\n"
" Dréck entweder Volume erop oder erof (III/IV)."

msgid ""
"The last two buttons marked 'V' and 'VI' are useful to make your screen "
"darker or brighter.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down (V/VI)."
msgstr ""
"Déi lescht zwou Tasten markéiert 'V' an 'VI' sinn nëtzlech fir däi "
"Bildschierm méi däischter oder méi hell ze maachen.\n"
"Bedenk, wat méi hell de Bildschierm, wat méi Energie e verbraucht!\n"
"\n"
"Dréck entweder Helligkeet erop oder erof (V/VI)."

msgid ""
"Now you're ready to start your RETROGAMING experience with Recalbox! Press "
"button B to start... and PLAY AGAIN!"
msgstr ""
"Elo bass du prett fir deng RETROGAMING-Erfarung mat Recalbox unzefänken! "
"Dréck op d'Tast B fir unzefänken... a SPILL NEI!"

msgid "WELCOME TO RECALBOX!"
msgstr "WËLLKOMM BEI RECALBOX!"

msgid ""
"Just a few words about the POWER button.\n"
"Make a short press, just like a mouse click, and your console will enter "
"sleep mode. Make another short press and your console will restart instanly! "
"Work in Recalbox interface and in-game!\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"Just e puer Wierder iwwer d'POWER-Tast.\n"
"Maach en kuerzen Dréck, wéi e Mausklick, an deng Konsol geet an de "
"Schlofmodus. Maach nach e kuerzen Dréck an deng Konsol start direkt nei! "
"Funktionnéiert an der Recalbox-Interface an am Spill!\n"
"\n"
"Dréck op d'Tast B fir weiderzegoen."

msgid ""
"If you push the POWER button more than 2 seconds, this will power-off your "
"console. If you do so in-game, Recalbox will close the current emulator "
"gracefully.\n"
"Just in case, holding the POWER button down more than 5s perform an hard "
"power-off.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"Wann s de d'POWER-Tast méi wéi 2 Sekonnen dréckste, gëtt deng Konsol "
"ausgeschalt. Wann s de dat am Spill méchs, wäert Recalbox den aktuellen "
"Emulator korrekt zoumaachen.\n"
"Fir all Fall, d'POWER-Tast méi wéi 5s ze halen féiert eng haart Ausschaltung "
"duer.\n"
"\n"
"Dréck op d'Tast B fir weiderzegoen."

msgid ""
"One more thing to know: If you plug in or unplug your headphones in the jack "
"connector, Recalbox will automatically switch the audio output. Convenient.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Nach eng Saach ze wëssen: Wann s du deng Kopfhörer an de Jack-Uschloss "
"steckst oder ausdréckst, wäert Recalbox automatesch d'Audio-Ausgang "
"wiesselen. Bequem.\n"
"\n"
"Dréck op d'Tast B, wéi ëmmer."

