"\n"
"Dréck op d'SELECT-Tast."

msgid ""
"At the opposite side of the SELECT button is the START button.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"Op der entgéintgesater Säit vun der SELECT-Tast ass d'START-Tast.\n"
"Benotz se fir d'Haaptmenü an der Recalbox-Interface opzemaachen an am Spill "
"wéi déi normal START-Tast déi op de meeschte Konsolen verfügbar ass.\n"
"\n"
"Dréck w.e.g. op dës START-Tast."

msgid ""
"Then, on the top of the console, there are 2 buttons marked with a '-' and a "
"'+'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press any button to continue"
msgstr ""
"Uewen op der Konsol sinn 2 Tasten markéiert mat '-' an '+'.\n"
"Benotz se fir de Volume jidderzäit an der Recalbox-Interface oder am Spill "
"z'erhéijen oder ze senken.\n"
"\n"
" Dréck op eng Tast fir weiderzegoen"

msgid ""
"The two bottom-left gray buttons control the screen brightness.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down button"
msgstr ""
"Déi zwou gro Tasten ënne lénks kontrolléieren d'Helligkeet vum Bildschierm.\n"
"Bedenk, wat méi hell de Bildschierm, wat méi Energie e verbraucht!\n"
"\n"
" Dréck entweder d'Helligkeet-erop- oder -erof-Tast"

msgid ""
"Finally, the two bottom-right gray buttons are third left & right triggers "
"(L3/R3), only usefull in some emulators or to record videos.\n"
"\n"
" Press either L3 or R3"
msgstr ""
"Endlech, déi zwou gro Tasten ënne riets sinn drëtt lénks a riets Ausléiser "
"(L3/R3), nëmme bei e puer Emulatoren oder fir Videoen ze filmen nëtzlech.\n"
"\n"
" Dréck entweder L3 oder R3"

