"We still hope to see you back soon as a Recalbox Patron!\n"
"Delete your private key to suppress this message."
msgstr ""
"Salut %NAME%, däi private Schlëssel ass mat engem Patreon-Kont verbonnen, "
"dee kee Recalbox-Patron méi ass.\n"
"Mir hoffen ëmmer nach dech geschwënn nees als Recalbox-Patron ze gesinn!\n"
"Läsch däi private Schlëssel fir dës Noriicht ze ënnerdrécken."

msgid ""
"Your private key does not allow to retrieve your Patreon information. Go to "
"recalbox.com/patreon to generate a new valid key!"
msgstr ""
"Däi private Schlëssel erlaabt et net, deng Patreon-Informatioune ze kréien. "
"Gëff op recalbox.com/patreon fir en neie gültegen Schlëssel ze generéieren!"

msgid ""
"Sorry we're not able to retrieve your Patron level because no network is "
"available!"
msgstr ""
"Entschëllegung, mir kënnen däi Patron-Niveau net kréien, well kee Netzwierk "
"verfügbar ass!"

msgid ""
"We're not able to retrieve your Patron level! Sorry for the inconvenience, "
"we're already working on a fix!"
msgstr ""
"Mir kënnen däi Patron-Niveau net kréien! Entschëllegung fir "
"d'Onannehmlechkeet, mir schaffen scho un enger Léisung!"

msgid "CASE MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "GEHÄIS-VERWALTUNG"

msgid ""
"If you installed a case on your Recalbox, you can install or uninstall it in "
"this menu. Some cases are detected automatically and will also be reported "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Wann s du e Gehäis op denger Recalbox installéiert hues, kanns du et hei "
"installéieren oder deinstalléieren. E puer Gehäiser gi automatesch entdeckt "
"a ginn och hei ugewisen."

msgid ""
"The USB device %NAME% with no rom folder and no share folder has been "
"plugged in! Would you like to initialize this device?"
msgstr ""
"Den USB-Apparat %NAME% ouni Rom-Ordner an ouni Share-Ordner gouf ugeschloss! "
"Wëlls du dëse Apparat initialiséieren?"

msgid "• Choose '%INIT%' to create only all the rom folders"
