msgid "Libretro HatariB Settings"
msgstr "Libretro HatariB-Einstellungen"

msgid "Machine Type"
msgstr "Maschinentyp"

msgid ""
"Choose the machine model to emulate. STE is a good choice for most games."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'Maschinemodell fir z'emuléieren. STE ass eng gutt Wiel fir déi "
"meescht Spiller."

msgid "Memory Size"
msgstr "Speicheregréisst"

msgid "Select the amount of memory. 1 MB is enough for gaming."
msgstr "Wiel d'Quantitéit u Späicher. 1 MB ass genuch fir ze spillen."

msgid "Fast Floppy"
msgstr "Schnell Disquette"

msgid ""
"Set ON to accelerate the floppy disc emulation. May cause some games to fail!"
msgstr ""
"Setz op ON fir d'Disquette-Emulatioun ze beschleunegen. Kann derfir suergen, "
"dass e puer Spiller net funktionnéieren!"

msgid "Libretro Fuse Settings"
msgstr "Libretro Fuse-Einstellungen"

msgid ""
"Choose the Sinclair machine (or clone) to emulate. The original Spectrum "
"128k is a good way to start."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'Sinclair-Maschinn (oder Klon) fir z'emuléieren. Den original Spectrum "
"128k ass e gudde Wee fir unzefänken."

msgid "Set ON to accelerate the tape emulation. May cause some games to fail!"
msgstr ""
"Setz op ON fir d'Kassett-Emulatioun ze beschleunegen. Kann derfir suergen, "
"dass e puer Spiller net funktionnéieren!"

msgid "Libretro PX68K Settings"
msgstr "Libretro PX68K-Einstellungen"

msgid "Model/CPU Speed"
msgstr "Modell/CPU-Geschwandegkeet"

msgid ""
"Choose the CPU frequency to emulate. 10Mhz is the basic machine and will "
"work for most of the games."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'CPU-Frequenz fir z'emuléieren. 10Mhz ass déi Basismaschinn a wäert "
"fir déi meescht Spiller funktionnéieren."

msgid "Memory Size (in MB)"
msgstr "Speicheregréisst (a MB)"

msgid ""
"Choose the amount of memory available. Most of the games will work with 2MB "
"but some games may require 4MB."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'verfügbar Späichermenge. Déi meescht Spiller wäerten mat 2MB "
"funktionnéieren, awer e puer Spiller kënnen 4MB brauchen."

msgid "Dolphin / Dolphin-GUI Settings"
msgstr "Dolphin / Dolphin-GUI-Einstellungen"

msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Opléisung"

msgid "Choose the internal resolution."
msgstr "Wiel déi intern Opléisung."

msgid "Dual CPU"
msgstr "Dual-CPU"

msgid ""
"May improve performance on a few rare games, at the expense of others that "
"are incompatible."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéier dës Optioun wann se d'Performance vun e puer seltene Spiller "
"verbesseren kann, awer op Käschte vun anere, déi net kompatibel ginn."

msgid "Sync GPU"
msgstr "GPU synchroniséieren"

msgid "Enable this speed hack for dual core mode to fix some glitches."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéier dëse Geschwindegkeets-Hack fir de Dual-Core-Modus fir e puer "
"Feeler ze fixéieren."

msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing"

msgid "Enable or disable anti-aliasing."
msgstr "Aktivéier oder deaktivéier den Anti-Aliasing."

msgid "VSync"
msgstr "VSync"

msgid "Enable or disable vsync."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéier dës Optioun fir de VSync z'aktivéieren oder ze deaktivéieren."

msgid "Real Gamecube controllers"
msgstr "Richteg Gamecube-Fernsteierungen"

msgid "Enable this option to play with real GameCube controllers."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéier dës Optioun fir mat richtegen GameCube-Fernsteierungen ze spillen."

msgid "Real Wiimotes"
msgstr "Richteg Wiimotes"

msgid "Enable this option to play with real Wiimotes."
msgstr "Aktivéier dës Optioun fir mat richtegen Wiimotes ze spillen."

msgid "Emulated Wiimote"
msgstr "Emuléiert Wiimote"

msgid "Enable this option to play with emulated Wiimotes."
msgstr "Aktivéier fir mat emuléierte Wiimotes ze spillen."

msgid "Dolphinbar position"
msgstr "Dolphinbar-Positioun"

msgid "Choose the position of the Dolphin bar."
msgstr "Wiel d'Positioun vun der Dolphin-Bar."

msgid "Show on-screen information"
msgstr "Informatiounen um Bildschierm weisen"

msgid "PPSSPP Settings"
msgstr "PPSSPP-Einstellungen"

msgid "Choose the internal resolution of the PSP."
msgstr "Wiel déi intern Opléisung vun der PSP."

msgid "SCUMMVM Settings"
msgstr "SCUMMVM-Einstellungen"

msgid "Subtitles"
msgstr "Ënnertitelen"

msgid "Enable subtitles"
msgstr "Ënnertitelen aktivéieren"

msgid "Supermodel Settings - Controllers"
msgstr "Supermodel-Einstellungen - Fernsteierungen"

msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilitéit"

msgid ""
"Choose the rate at which analog control values increase/decrease when "
"controlled by a key, between 1 to 100. Default is 25."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'Rate mat där analog Steierungswäerter eropgoen/erofgoen wa se vun "
"enger Tast gesteiert ginn, tëschent 1 an 100. Standard ass 25."

msgid "Saturation"
msgstr "Sättegung"

msgid ""
"Choose the position at which the joystick is interpreted as being in its "
"most extreme position, between 0% to 200%. Default is 100%."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'Positioun bei där de Joystick als am extremsten Positioun "
"interpretéiert gëtt, tëschent 0% an 200%. Standard ass 100%."

msgid "Deadzone"
msgstr "Doudzon"

msgid "Choose the dead zone as a percentage, between 0% to 99%. Default is 2%."
msgstr "Wiel d'Doudzon als Prozentsaz, tëschent 0% an 99%. Standard ass 2%."

msgid "Supermodel Settings - Audio"
msgstr "Supermodel-Einstellungen - Audio"

msgid "Sound volume"
msgstr "Touvolume"

msgid ""
"Choose the master volume in percentage, between 0% to 100%. Default is 100%."
msgstr ""
"Wiel den Haaptvolume a Prozent, tëschent 0% an 100%. Standard ass 100%."

msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "Musekvolume"

msgid ""
"Choose the music volume in percentage, between 0% to 100%. Default is 100%."
msgstr "Wiel de Musekvolume a Prozent, tëschent 0% an 100%. Standard ass 100%."

msgid "Balance"
msgstr "Ausgläich"

msgid ""
"Choose the relative front/rear balance in percentage, between 0% to 100%. "
"Default is 0%."
msgstr ""
"Wiel den relative Fënster-/Réck-Ausgläich a Prozent, tëschent 0% an 100%. "
"Standard ass 0%."

msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Kanäl"

msgid "Choose the number of sound channels to use on host. Default is 2."
msgstr "Wiel d'Zuel vun de Tounkanäl op der Host. Standard ass 2."

msgid "Flip stereo"
msgstr "Stereo ëmdréinen"

msgid "Swap the left and right audio channels."
msgstr "Wiel ob s de déi lénks a riets Audiokanäl vertauschs."

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Toun"

msgid ""
"Choose if you disable sound board emulation sound effects. Default is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Wiel ob s d'Tounkaart-Emulatiounseffekter deaktivéiers. Standard ass "
"deaktivéiert."

msgid "No Digital Sound Board (DSB)"
msgstr "Keng digital Tounkaart (DSB)"

msgid "Enable or disable Digital Sound Board MPEG music. Default is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéier oder deaktivéier d'MPEG-Musek vun der digitaler Tounkaart. "
"Standard ass deaktivéiert."

msgid "Sound engine"
msgstr "Toun-Motor"

msgid ""
"Choose between the legacy and new sound engines. Default is MAME engine."
msgstr ""
"Wiel tëschent dem alen an dem neien Toun-Motor. Standard ass de MAME-Motor."

msgid "Supermodel Settings - Video"
msgstr "Supermodel-Einstellungen - Video"

msgid "Supersampling"
msgstr "Supersampling"

msgid "Supersampling. Not enabled yet. Default is 1."
msgstr "Supersampling. Nach net aktivéiert. Standard ass 1."

msgid "Upscale"
msgstr "Verbesserung"

msgid "Choose the 2D layer upscaling filter mode. Default is 0."
msgstr "Wiel de Filtermodus fir d'2D-Schicht-Verbesserung. Standard ass 0."

msgid "Disable no throttle"
msgstr "Ouni Begrenzung deaktivéieren"

msgid "Enable or disable the 60Hz frame rate lock. Default is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Wiel ob s de d'60Hz-Biller-Rate-Blockéierung aktivéiere wëlls oder net. "
"Standard ass deaktivéiert."

msgid "Lock the vertical refresh rate. Default is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Wiel fir d'vertikal Aktualiséierungsrate ze blockéieren. Standard ass "
"aktivéiert."

msgid "True Hz"
msgstr "Richtegen Hz"

msgid "Use the true Model 3 refresh rate of 57.524 Hz. Default is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Wiel fir déi richteg Model 3-Aktualiséierungsrate vu 57,524 Hz ze benotzen. "
"Standard ass deaktivéiert."

msgid "Crosshairs"
msgstr "Ziil"

msgid "Show crosshairs. Default is disabled."
msgstr "Wiel ob s de d'Ziil weise wëlls. Standard ass deaktivéiert."

msgid "Multi texture"
msgstr "Multi-Textur"

msgid "Use 8 texture maps for decoding. Default is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Wiel ob s de 8 Textur-Kaarte fir d'Decodéiere benotze wëlls. Standard ass "
"deaktivéiert."

msgid "Quad rendering"
msgstr "Quad-Rendering"

msgid "Enable proper quad rendering. Default is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Wiel ob s de richtegt Quad-Rendering aktivéiere wëlls. Standard ass "
"deaktivéiert."

msgid "Supermodel Settings - Core"
msgstr "Supermodel-Einstellungen - Core"

msgid "GPU multi threading"
msgstr "GPU-Multi-Threading"

msgid ""
"Set to ON to run GPU in its own thread instead of sharing the CPU thread. "
"Faster but may cause bugs, depending on the game."
msgstr ""
"Op ON stellen, fir datt d'GPU an hirem eegene Thread leeft, amplaz de CPU-"
"Thread ze deelen. Méi séier, mä kann ofhängeg vum Spill Feeler verursaachen."

msgid "PPC Frequency"
msgstr "PPC-Frequenz"

msgid "Choose the PowerPC frequency in MHz, between 1 to 1000. Default is 70."
msgstr "Wiel d'PowerPC-Frequenz a MHz, tëschent 1 an 1000. Standard ass 70."

msgid "Service button"
msgstr "Service-Tast"

msgid ""
"Enable or disable the service menu in games (L3 = test, R3 = service). "
"Default is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéier oder deaktivéier de Service-Menü an de Spiller (L3 = Test, R3 = "
"Service). Standard ass aktivéiert."

msgid "Log level"
msgstr "Log-Niveau"

msgid "Choose the level of detail in the log file. Default is Information."
msgstr ""
"Wiel den Niveau vun Informatiounen an der Log-Datei. Standard ass "
"Informatiounen."

msgid "Xemu Settings"
msgstr "Xemu-Einstellungen"

msgid "Choose the internal resolution of the Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel déi intern Opléisung vun der Xbox."

msgid "Show menu bar"
msgstr "Menüleescht weisen"

msgid "Show the menu bar."
msgstr "Wiel ob s d'Menüleescht weise wëlls."

msgid "Skip boot animation"
msgstr "Start-Animatioun iwwersprangen"

msgid "Skip the boot animation."
msgstr "Wiel ob s d'Start-Animatioun iwwersprange wëlls."

msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Notifikatiounen weisen"

msgid "Show the notifications displayed in the top-right corner of the screen."
msgstr "Weist d'Notifikatiounen uewen riets um Bildschirm un."

msgid "Display mode"
msgstr "Display-Modus"

msgid "Choose how the framebuffer should fit or scale."
msgstr "Wiel wéi de Framebuffer sech uspasse soll."

msgid "Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "Verhältnis"

msgid "Choose the aspect ratio of the Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel d'Verhältnis vun der Xbox."

msgid "Xemu - EEPROM General Settings"
msgstr "Xemu - Allgemeng EEPROM-Einstellungen"

msgid "Choose the region to use on Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel d'Regioun fir op der Xbox ze benotzen."

msgid "Video Standard"
msgstr "Video-Standard"

msgid "Choose the video standard to use on Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel de Video-Standard fir op der Xbox ze benotzen."

msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Zäitzon"

msgid ""
"Choose the timezone to use on Xbox. If your country is using DST, don't take "
"it into account when you are setting this."
msgstr ""
"Wiel d'Zäitzon fir op der Xbox ze benotzen. Wann däi Land Summerzäit "
"benotzt, berücksichteg dat net bei dëser Astellung."

msgid "Disable automatic daylight saving time"
msgstr "Automatesch Summerzäit deaktivéieren"

msgid "Choose if you want to disable automatic daylight saving time."
msgstr "Wiel ob s d'automatesch Summerzäit deaktivéiere wëlls."

msgid "DVD Region"
msgstr "DVD-Regioun"

msgid "Choose the DVD region to use on Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel d'DVD-Regioun fir op der Xbox ze benotzen."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Sprooch"

msgid "Choose the language to use on Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel d'Sprooch fir op der Xbox ze benotzen."

msgid "Xemu - EEPROM Video Settings"
msgstr "Xemu - EEPROM-Video-Einstellungen"

msgid "Enable 480p resolution on Xbox."
msgstr "Aktivéier d'480p-Opléisung op der Xbox."

msgid "720p"
msgstr "720p"

msgid "Enable 720p resolution on Xbox."
msgstr "Aktivéier d'720p-Opléisung op der Xbox."

msgid "1080i"
msgstr "1080i"

msgid "Enable 1080i resolution on Xbox."
msgstr "Aktivéier d'1080i-Opléisung op der Xbox."

msgid "Video Mode"
msgstr "Video-Modus"

msgid "Choose the video mode to use on Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel de Video-Modus fir op der Xbox ze benotzen."

msgid "Refresh rate"
msgstr "Aktualiséierungsrate"

msgid "Set the refresh rate to 60Hz on Xbox."
msgstr "Aktivéier d'Aktualiséierungsrate op 60Hz op der Xbox."

msgid "Xemu - EEPROM Audio Settings"
msgstr "Xemu - EEPROM-Audio-Einstellungen"

msgid "Audio Output"
msgstr "Audio-Ausgang"

msgid "Choose the audio output to use on Xbox."
msgstr "Wiel d'Audio-Ausgang fir op der Xbox ze benotzen."

msgid "AC3"
msgstr "AC3"

msgid "Enable Dolby Digital (AC3) on Xbox."
msgstr "Aktivéier Dolby Digital (AC3) op der Xbox."

msgid "DTS"
msgstr "DTS"

msgid "Enable Dolby Surround (DTS) on Xbox."
msgstr "Aktivéier Dolby Surround (DTS) op der Xbox."

msgid "SHUTDOWN RECALBOX"
msgstr "RECALBOX AUSSCHALTEN"

msgid "FAST SHUTDOWN RECALBOX"
msgstr "RECALBOX SCHNELL AUSSCHALTEN"

msgid "RESTART RECALBOX"
msgstr "RECALBOX NEI STARTEN"

msgid "EDIT NETPLAY PASSWORDS"
msgstr "NETPLAY-PASSWIERDER EDITÉIEREN"

msgid "PASSWORD #{INDEX}"
msgstr "PASSWUERT #{INDEX}"

msgid "SHARE USAGE"
msgstr "SHARE-VERBRAUCH"

msgid "SHARE PARTITION"
msgstr "SHARE-PARTITION"

msgid "Exit the password edition."
msgstr "Beeend d'Passwuert-Editéierung."

msgid "AVAILABLE STORAGES"
msgstr "VERFÜGBAR SPÄICHERUNGEN"

msgid ""
"Show a list of storage available on your system. Select a storage to access "
"extra information and available actions."
msgstr ""
"Weis eng Lëscht vu Späicherungen déi op dengem System verfügbar sinn. Wiel "
"eng Späicherung fir zousätzlech Informatiounen an disponibel Aktiounen "
"z'erreechen."

msgid "Get information about {DEVICE.NAME}"
msgstr "Informatioune iwwer {DEVICE.NAME} kréien"

msgid "FREE SPACE"
msgstr "FRÄI PLAZ"

msgid "Display free space available on the device"
msgstr "Weis déi fräi Plaz déi um Apparat verfügbar ass"

msgid "STORAGE NAME"
msgstr "SPÄICHERUNGSNUMM"

msgid "Display real device name"
msgstr "Weis de richtege Apparatnumm"

msgid "NETWORK ACCESS"
msgstr "NETZWIERKZUGANG"

msgid "Access to this storage through your local network."
msgstr "Zugang zu dëser Späicherung iwwer däi lokaalt Netzwierk."

msgid "FILE SYSTEM"
msgstr "DATEISYSTEM"

msgid "FileSystem"
msgstr "Dateisystem"

msgid "COMPATIBLE WITH RECALBOX?"
msgstr "KOMPATIBEL MAT RECALBOX?"

msgid "Show if this storage is compatible with recalbox"
msgstr "Weis ob dës Späicherung mat Recalbox kompatibel ass"

msgid "INSTALL RECALBOX ROM FOLDERS"
msgstr "RECALBOX-ROM-ORDNER INSTALLÉIEREN"

msgid "INITIALIZE!"
msgstr "INITIALISÉIEREN!"

msgid ""
"Create rom structure so that this storage will be used by Recalbox on next "
"boots."
msgstr ""
"Erstell d'Romstruktur, sou dass dës Späicherung vu Recalbox bei den nächste "
"Started benotzt gëtt."

msgid ""
"You cannot initialize this storage, because either it is already initialized "
"or it is not compatible."
msgstr ""
"Du kanns dës Späicherung net initialiséieren, well se entweder scho "
"initialiséiert ass oder net kompatibel ass."

msgid ""
"Select your language. A reboot is required to set this configuration active."
msgstr ""
"Wiel deng Sprooch. En Neistart ass néideg fir dës Konfiguratioun ze "
"aktivéieren."

msgid "TIMEZONE"
msgstr "ZÄITZON"

msgid ""
"Select the timezone used to display dates and times in their local format."
msgstr ""
"Erlaabt d'Wiele vun der Zäitzon fir Datumen an Zäiten a hirem lokaalen "
"Format ze weisen."

msgid "Shows available update version."
