#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — first warning title (destructive)
msgid "WARNING ! DESTRUCTIVE OPERATION !"
msgstr "OPGEPASST! ZERSTÉIERENDEN VIRGANG!"

#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — first warning body, disk with partitions
#: AND data
msgid ""
"**{DEVICE}** contains **partitions with existing data**.\n"
"\n"
"If you confirm, Recalbox will **permanently and irreversibly**:\n"
"\n"
"- Erase **all partitions** on this disk\n"
"- **Destroy all data** present on those partitions\n"
"\n"
"**There is no going back.** Once confirmed, there is absolutely no way to "
"recover your files or partitions.\n"
"\n"
"Are you **absolutely sure** you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"**{DEVICE}** enthält **Partitiounen mat existéierende Donnéeën**.\n"
"\n"
"Wann Dir confirméiert, wäert Recalbox **permanent an onëmkéierbar**:\n"
"\n"
"- **All Partitiounen** op dëser Disk läschen\n"
"- **All Donnéeën** op deene Partitiounen zerstéieren\n"
"\n"
"**Et gëtt kee Réckgang.** No der Bestätegung gëtt et absolut keng "
"Méiglechkeet méi fir Är Fichieren oder Partitiounen erëmzefannen.\n"
"\n"
"Sidd Dir Iech **ganz sécher**, datt Dir weiderfuere wëllt?"

#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — first warning body, disk with partitions
#: but no detected data
msgid ""
"**{DEVICE}** already has partitions.\n"
"\n"
"If you confirm, Recalbox will **permanently and irreversibly erase all "
"existing partitions** on this disk.\n"
"\n"
"**There is no going back.**\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"**{DEVICE}** huet schonn Partitiounen.\n"
"\n"
"Wann Dir confirméiert, wäert Recalbox **all existéierend Partitiounen op "
"dëser Disk permanent an onëmkéierbar läschen**.\n"
"\n"
"**Et gëtt kee Réckgang.**\n"
"\n"
"Sidd Dir sécher, datt Dir weiderfuere wëllt?"

#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — second confirmation title
msgid "LAST WARNING BEFORE INSTALLATION"
msgstr "LETZT WARNUNG VIRUM INSTALLÉIEREN"

#: MenuProvider.cpp InstallDevice — second confirmation body
msgid ""
"The installation of Recalbox on **{DEVICE}** may take **several minutes**.\n"
"\n"
"⚠ **Do NOT** shut down or reboot Recalbox during the installation.\n"
"If the process is interrupted, the disk may be left in an unusable state.\n"
"\n"
"You can still change your mind and **cancel right now**."
msgstr ""
"D'Installatioun vu Recalbox op **{DEVICE}** kann **e puer Minutten** "
"daueren.\n"
"\n"
"⚠ **Maacht net** Recalbox aus oder start et wärend der Installatioun nei.\n"
"Wann de Prozess ënnerbrach gëtt, kann d'Disk an engem onbenotzbare Zoustand "
"bleiwen.\n"
"\n"
"Dir kënnt Iech nach ëmentscheeden a **elo direkt ofbriechen**."

#: GuiInstallRecalbox.cpp — window title
msgid "INSTALLATION IN PROGRESS..."
msgstr "INSTALLATIOUN AM GANG..."

#: GuiInstallRecalbox.cpp — body text shown during installation
msgid ""
"Installing Recalbox on **{DEVICE}**...\n"
"\n"
"⚠ **Do NOT** shut down or reboot Recalbox during the installation process.\n"
"If the installation is interrupted, the disk may be left in an unusable "
"state.\n"
"\n"
"Please wait — this may take **several minutes**."
msgstr ""
"Recalbox gëtt op **{DEVICE}** installéiert...\n"
"\n"
"⚠ **Maacht net** Recalbox aus oder start et wärend dem Installatiounsprozess "
"nei.\n"
"Wann d'Installatioun ënnerbrach gëtt, kann d'Disk an engem onbenotzbare "
"Zoustand bleiwen.\n"
"\n"
"Waart wgl. — dëst kann **e puer Minutten** daueren."

